{"version":1,"content":"<p>實驗性項目XNU Linux成功在ARM64 Linux系統上啓動完整的macOS 27桌面，為用户在不使用傳統虛擬化的情況下運行蘋果作業系統提供了一條全新路徑。這一進展對熱衷於打造定製化macOS桌面，也就是俗稱黑蘋果的愛好者羣體而言具有相當重要的意義。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587752.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:03:56.205466+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:42:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:57:14.843404+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T02:57:14.843404+00:00","content_hash":"69d8bd9890b5d0ae8b387d1a5bd43b63971d8d5dce61a2b0a0d84d5a61dfae13","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}